	"pageType" : {
		"__type" : "namedPage",
		"title" : "The Account Tree Is Not the Territory"
	},
	"children" : {
		"__type" : "snippets",
		"items" : [
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-04T09:51:26.711904-04:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-04T10:08:49.65925-04:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "JJEB4OquQLC26Kqo80xT5g=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "The world does not fit in a hierarchy.\n\nOne purchase may matter to several {{gtClass:MpPerson|label=people}}, advance a {{gtClass:PpProject|label=project}}, satisfy an {{gtClass:VsAgreement|label=agreement}}, support several {{gtClass:PpValue|label=values}}, and involve a durable object."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-04T09:51:26.71214-04:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-04T09:51:26.71214-04:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "nKz8kXr/Tj200y53mAxUwQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "An account tree asks which aspect matters most.\n\nThat is often the wrong question."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-04T09:51:26.712381-04:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-04T10:07:25.208513-04:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "+GJDq5VqShmGBCjM0EH7Xg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Many systems notice the problem and add tags, classes, projects, or dimensions.\n\n\t**The account tree, now with aftermarket accessories.**"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-04T09:51:26.712628-04:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-04T09:51:26.712628-04:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "W8Wrf6Z4QkWKtrX6cblQVA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "These tools help. They also leave two homes for meaning: the official hierarchy and the analytical escape hatch.\n\nUsers must still decide which truths deserve accounts and which are secondary."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-04T09:51:26.712825-04:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-04T10:09:43.252453-04:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "lMeSXXsUSH+3qLB/lFH4LA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Virtual Stash does not seek a better pigeonhole.\n\n**We move meaning out of the pigeonhole business.**"
			},
